# HP50g stock ARMToolbox install.
# Keep the required real port number 2. on the stack, enter SETUP.BIN through
# the stock SD File Manager, and use its EVAL action so the firmware performs
# the port-3 file recall/conversion before executing the installer.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
6300 tap two
6600 tap period
6900 tap enter
7500 capture install-home
8000 chord lshift files
10200 capture files
10500 tap up
10800 tap f6
12800 capture sd
13300 tap enter
14100 capture sd-setup
14600 tap f5
16500 capture setup-eval
17500 chord on f3
19500 finish-install
